{
  "description": "Shared contract for how the gateway's baseline request events (pkg/plugins/gateway/tre_bl_req_events.go: blReissue, blInputTokens) classify the requests the reissue sidecar (tre/reissue/tre_reissue/sidecar.py) re-sends through the gateway. depth_header = the sidecar's Config.depth_header default. Each case is one request as it reaches the gateway: path, the x-tre-* request headers (all of them, names lower case) and the JSON body. from = client | sidecar_retry | sidecar_continue_completion | sidecar_continue_chat; the sidecar cases are recorded from the sidecar test harness (tre/reissue/tests/test_reissue_sidecar.py: test_gateway_reissue_contract re-creates each one and compares). reissue / in_tokens / in_src / client_id = the gateway's arr event fields (client_id = the client's x-tre-request-id, which the sidecar forwards unchanged). Regenerate the sidecar cases after a sidecar change: cd tre && TRE_REGEN_GW_CONTRACT=1 PYTHONPATH=reissue python3 -m pytest reissue/tests/test_reissue_sidecar.py -k gateway_reissue_contract",
  "depth_header": "x-tre-reissue-depth",
